{"slug": "C_S03E09", "video_name": "Community - S03E09 - Foosball and Nocturnal Vigilantism Bluray-1080p Proper.mkv", "subtitle_name": "Community - S03E09 - Foosball and Nocturnal Vigilantism Bluray-1080p Proper.en.srt", "duration_seconds": 1281.786, "language": "en", "stt_provider": "local", "stt_model": "ggml-small.en-q5_1.bin", "segment_count": 483, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 3.4285714285714284, "text": "Happy Friday, everybody!"}, {"start": 3.4285714285714284, "end": 8.0, "text": "What are you doing this weekend?"}, {"start": 8.0, "end": 11.0, "text": "The question is, who am I doing this weekend?"}, {"start": 11.0, "end": 13.345454545454546, "text": "He's asking because he's already forgotten."}, {"start": 13.345454545454546, "end": 14.0, "text": "It's nobody."}, {"start": 14.0, "end": 16.0, "text": "I'm volunteering at the Animal Hospital."}, {"start": 16.0, "end": 17.066666666666666, "text": "Animal Hospital?"}, {"start": 17.066666666666666, "end": 19.0, "text": "The animals are the patients."}, {"start": 19.0, "end": 20.0, "text": "That makes sense."}, {"start": 20.0, "end": 20.375, "text": "Yeah, Dr."}, {"start": 20.375, "end": 23.0, "text": "Zismore's letting me work off the cost of Daniel's eye surgery."}, {"start": 23.0, "end": 24.89010989010989, "text": "Wait, you won't spend money on a name brand"}, {"start": 24.89010989010989, "end": 27.0, "text": "phone, but you got LASIK for your geriatric cat?"}, {"start": 27.0, "end": 28.956521739130434, "text": "He only has the one eye, Jeff."}, {"start": 28.956521739130434, "end": 31.891304347826086, "text": "I can't exactly buy him a cat monocle, can I?"}, {"start": 31.891304347826086, "end": 33.0, "text": "It's pretentious."}, {"start": 33.0, "end": 36.0, "text": "And for your information, this is a toad-a-roll up."}, {"start": 40.0, "end": 44.0, "text": "Troy and I will be having a very special Saturday night, as in \"Dark Night.\""}, {"start": 44.0, "end": 44.46783625730994, "text": "It came!"}, {"start": 44.46783625730994, "end": 49.380116959064324, "text": "Unlimited Edition, $299 Dark Night DVD with bonus footage, special commentary, and a"}, {"start": 49.380116959064324, "end": 54.0, "text": "Christian Bale autograph, including a personalized message of up to four words!"}, {"start": 54.0, "end": 57.0, "text": "Abed is Batman now, Christian Bale."}, {"start": 57.0, "end": 59.0, "text": "It's official, from the man himself."}, {"start": 59.0, "end": 61.0, "text": "We have that back end, thank you."}, {"start": 61.0, "end": 63.06993006993007, "text": "And just to clarify, if you see this lying out, I'm still using it, so you"}, {"start": 63.06993006993007, "end": 65.0, "text": "don't have to take it to the kitchen, dump it out, and wash the bowl."}, {"start": 65.0, "end": 66.0, "text": "Is this about your buttered noodles?"}, {"start": 66.0, "end": 67.0, "text": "I didn't say that."}, {"start": 67.0, "end": 69.0, "text": "Food Bowl!"}, {"start": 69.0, "end": 70.0, "text": "Yay!"}, {"start": 70.0, "end": 72.0, "text": "Do your face!"}, {"start": 72.0, "end": 73.0, "text": "Do your witness!"}, {"start": 73.0, "end": 74.75714285714285, "text": "What is it with those tools and foosball?"}, {"start": 74.75714285714285, "end": 76.0, "text": "They've been at it for weeks."}, {"start": 76.0, "end": 77.04166666666667, "text": "I think they're European."}, {"start": 77.04166666666667, "end": 79.0, "text": "It's probably a more important game over there."}, {"start": 79.0, "end": 81.0, "text": "Foosball's like the soccer ping pong."}, {"start": 81.0, "end": 82.0, "text": "I can't take it anymore."}, {"start": 82.0, "end": 84.0, "text": "Jeffrey, let him be!"}, {"start": 84.0, "end": 86.0, "text": "Gentlemen, my name is Clarence Thaddeus Foos."}, {"start": 86.0, "end": 89.65217391304348, "text": "My grandfather, Fletcher Morton Foos, invented this game for"}, {"start": 89.65217391304348, "end": 93.0, "text": "one purpose, to have the loudest, dumbest thing happen."}, {"start": 93.0, "end": 94.0, "text": "Now, it has."}, {"start": 94.0, "end": 96.0, "text": "The game of foosball is completed."}, {"start": 96.0, "end": 101.0, "text": "You're free to return to your undoubtedly hearing impaired families."}, {"start": 101.0, "end": 103.17647058823529, "text": "Tell you what, will you stop playing?"}, {"start": 103.17647058823529, "end": 105.0, "text": "If you can score a point on us."}, {"start": 105.0, "end": 108.57, "text": "Tempting, but then, wouldn't I be playing foosball?"}, {"start": 108.57, "end": 112.0, "text": "And if so, how would I not be a loud, weird knob?"}, {"start": 112.0, "end": 112.6, "text": "Free shot!"}, {"start": 112.6, "end": 115.0, "text": "I'm not even touching the foosome shaft."}, {"start": 115.0, "end": 116.91666666666667, "text": "Sorry, little spaloons."}, {"start": 116.91666666666667, "end": 118.0, "text": "I'm above it."}, {"start": 122.0, "end": 126.0, "text": "I wish there was a word to describe the pleasure I feel at viewing misfortune."}, {"start": 126.0, "end": 128.0, "text": "The face of a broken man!"}, {"start": 128.0, "end": 130.0, "text": "Oh, smile!"}, {"start": 130.0, "end": 134.0, "text": "Uh, uh, uh, they, uh, they come in a six-pack."}, {"start": 135.0, "end": 138.0, "text": "♪ Give me some more, sometime in a dream ♪"}, {"start": 138.0, "end": 141.0, "text": "♪ Give me the hope to run out of steam ♪"}, {"start": 141.0, "end": 144.0, "text": "♪ Somebody say you could be here ♪"}, {"start": 144.0, "end": 148.0, "text": "♪ You could be going sometime up there ♪"}, {"start": 148.0, "end": 153.0, "text": "♪ And I can't count the reasons I should stay ♪"}, {"start": 153.0, "end": 159.0, "text": "♪ Walk by one, they all just fade away ♪"}, {"start": 166.0, "end": 168.0, "text": "Buttered noodles."}, {"start": 171.0, "end": 174.0, "text": "I don't know how to throw out the dust, right?"}, {"start": 186.151, "end": 188.151, "text": "[humming]"}, {"start": 195.151, "end": 196.151, "text": "What's wrong?"}, {"start": 201.876, "end": 202.876, "text": "I..."}, {"start": 203.876, "end": 204.876, "text": "[gasps]"}, {"start": 206.876, "end": 207.876, "text": "Why?"}, {"start": 207.876, "end": 208.876, "text": "I stepped on it."}, {"start": 208.876, "end": 209.876, "text": "Why?"}, {"start": 209.876, "end": 210.876, "text": "I was dusting the TV."}, {"start": 210.876, "end": 211.876, "text": "Why?"}, {"start": 211.876, "end": 213.876, "text": "I can run out and get a new one before he gets home."}, {"start": 213.876, "end": 214.876, "text": "Oh, sure, Annie."}, {"start": 214.876, "end": 218.876, "text": "And then we just have to record fake exclusive commentary by Christian Bale."}, {"start": 218.876, "end": 220.876, "text": "Go ahead, you first."}, {"start": 220.876, "end": 223.876, "text": "This scene was a special challenge to all involved."}, {"start": 223.876, "end": 224.2342089552239, "text": "Stop it!"}, {"start": 224.2342089552239, "end": 225.35361194029852, "text": "That's not a real option."}, {"start": 225.35361194029852, "end": 226.876, "text": "The disc is irreplaceably awesome."}, {"start": 226.876, "end": 229.876, "text": "What if we got a different disc and--"}, {"start": 229.876, "end": 232.876, "text": "Do you know how many sitcoms have done these secretly replace"}, {"start": 232.876, "end": 234.876, "text": "a broken, priceless item thing?"}, {"start": 234.876, "end": 236.18369230769233, "text": "'Cause Abed does."}, {"start": 236.18369230769233, "end": 237.876, "text": "Abed knows everything."}, {"start": 237.876, "end": 241.876, "text": "And I know you think you can think your way out of this with your thinkiness,"}, {"start": 241.876, "end": 243.876, "text": "but don't think too much."}, {"start": 243.876, "end": 246.876, "text": "You just have to confess, okay?"}, {"start": 246.876, "end": 247.876, "text": "Okay!"}, {"start": 247.876, "end": 250.876, "text": "[humming]"}, {"start": 254.482, "end": 256.48199999999997, "text": "We shot the scene on location."}, {"start": 259.635, "end": 260.7317741935484, "text": "Okay, he's ready."}, {"start": 260.7317741935484, "end": 261.635, "text": "It won't work."}, {"start": 266.635, "end": 269.635, "text": "Jeffrey, what are you doing?"}, {"start": 269.635, "end": 274.635, "text": "Oh, you know, I just thought next time those Deutsch bags try to show off,"}, {"start": 274.635, "end": 276.635, "text": "maybe I can catch 'em by surprise."}, {"start": 276.635, "end": 278.635, "text": "Jeff, you don't need to worry what foreigners think about you."}, {"start": 278.635, "end": 280.635, "text": "That's your birthright as an American."}, {"start": 282.635, "end": 285.635, "text": "Okay, small confession."}, {"start": 286.635, "end": 288.635, "text": "I used to love foosball."}, {"start": 288.635, "end": 292.635, "text": "It was a great after-school game for a lonely kid with no dad."}, {"start": 292.635, "end": 296.635, "text": "You know, just masculine enough without having to know how to throw or catch."}, {"start": 296.635, "end": 297.635, "text": "I have seen you throw."}, {"start": 297.635, "end": 299.635, "text": "And it was fun."}, {"start": 299.635, "end": 302.635, "text": "Until I started getting bullied by people like those Germans."}, {"start": 302.635, "end": 304.635, "text": "So I quit."}, {"start": 304.635, "end": 306.635, "text": "Well, you did the right thing."}, {"start": 306.635, "end": 310.635, "text": "Foosball is a vile game for vile people."}, {"start": 310.635, "end": 311.86227272727274, "text": "Surely you wouldn't get it."}, {"start": 311.86227272727274, "end": 312.635, "text": "It's a guy thing."}, {"start": 312.635, "end": 314.635, "text": "It's not a fresh baked pie thing."}, {"start": 314.635, "end": 317.635, "text": "Well, I might cute it a little."}, {"start": 323.635, "end": 325.635, "text": "You don't know me."}, {"start": 336.635, "end": 338.635, "text": "Holy crap."}, {"start": 338.635, "end": 340.635, "text": "All right, I think I figured out the viewing order."}, {"start": 340.635, "end": 343.635, "text": "Original version, director's cut, director's cut with commentary,"}, {"start": 343.635, "end": 345.635, "text": "and then original version cooled down."}, {"start": 345.635, "end": 347.635, "text": "Yeah, we'll see."}, {"start": 347.635, "end": 349.635, "text": "Mm-hmm."}, {"start": 349.635, "end": 353.635, "text": "Oh, my God, you guys, we've been robbed."}, {"start": 356.635, "end": 359.635, "text": "Oh, man, I can't believe we got robbed."}, {"start": 360.635, "end": 363.635, "text": "Shirley, Shirley, you have to teach me."}, {"start": 363.635, "end": 365.635, "text": "Please, help me beat those evil power crouts."}, {"start": 365.635, "end": 367.635, "text": "Don't you get it, Jeff?"}, {"start": 367.635, "end": 370.635, "text": "They're not evil people that are good at foosball."}, {"start": 370.635, "end": 373.635, "text": "They are good at foosball because they're evil."}, {"start": 373.635, "end": 376.635, "text": "It's an evil game that brings out the worst."}, {"start": 376.635, "end": 379.635, "text": "Like, like out-of-town weddings with receptions"}, {"start": 379.635, "end": 381.635, "text": "in the same place as everybody's rooms."}, {"start": 381.635, "end": 383.635, "text": "Great."}, {"start": 383.635, "end": 385.635, "text": "After three years of religious advice and carb-laden pastries,"}, {"start": 385.635, "end": 388.635, "text": "you finally have one thing I actually need."}, {"start": 388.635, "end": 390.635, "text": "And..."}, {"start": 390.635, "end": 392.635, "text": "I'm sorry."}, {"start": 392.635, "end": 394.635, "text": "Um, that was rude."}, {"start": 394.635, "end": 397.635, "text": "It shouldn't be so important to me."}, {"start": 397.635, "end": 399.635, "text": "I'll, uh, I'll see you Monday."}, {"start": 399.635, "end": 401.635, "text": "Jeff."}, {"start": 404.911, "end": 406.911, "text": "Tomorrow, dawn."}, {"start": 406.911, "end": 409.911, "text": "Be in a student lounge."}, {"start": 409.911, "end": 412.911, "text": "Shirley, you are the best."}, {"start": 416.911, "end": 419.911, "text": "Dear Lord, please forgive me."}, {"start": 419.911, "end": 421.911, "text": "And please have mercy on him."}, {"start": 421.911, "end": 423.911, "text": "The stakes have never been higher."}, {"start": 423.911, "end": 424.911, "text": "Shut up, Leonard."}, {"start": 424.911, "end": 426.911, "text": "I found your YouTube page."}, {"start": 426.911, "end": 428.911, "text": "What's the point in reviewing frozen pizza?"}, {"start": 428.911, "end": 430.911, "text": "You're talking about it."}, {"start": 430.911, "end": 432.911, "text": "Well, that is true."}, {"start": 437.911, "end": 439.911, "text": "Now, Jeffrey, the key to winning foosball"}, {"start": 439.911, "end": 441.911, "text": "is to tap into your darkness."}, {"start": 441.911, "end": 443.911, "text": "So I need you to promise you won't judge the side of me"}, {"start": 443.911, "end": 445.911, "text": "that might come out."}, {"start": 445.911, "end": 447.911, "text": "Shirley, I'm gonna be perfectly blunt with you."}, {"start": 447.911, "end": 449.911, "text": "The few times that you've been a little bad"}, {"start": 449.911, "end": 451.911, "text": "are the times I've liked you most."}, {"start": 451.911, "end": 452.911, "text": "Really?"}, {"start": 452.911, "end": 454.911, "text": "Remember making fun of Britta's boyfriend's tiny nipples?"}, {"start": 454.911, "end": 455.911, "text": "Oh, you little tiny."}, {"start": 455.911, "end": 457.911, "text": "Remember what you did to Pierce's hoagie?"}, {"start": 457.911, "end": 459.911, "text": "That was so disturbing, I almost proposed on the spot."}, {"start": 459.911, "end": 461.911, "text": "Now, come on."}, {"start": 461.911, "end": 463.911, "text": "Show me how to dominate."}, {"start": 463.911, "end": 465.911, "text": "All right, Winger."}, {"start": 465.911, "end": 466.911, "text": "On the grips."}, {"start": 466.911, "end": 468.911, "text": "We're coming up on your right side"}, {"start": 468.911, "end": 470.911, "text": "in three, two, one!"}, {"start": 470.911, "end": 471.911, "text": "You know why you can't stop me?"}, {"start": 471.911, "end": 473.911, "text": "'Cause I'm not playing a game."}, {"start": 473.911, "end": 475.911, "text": "For you, it's willing to lose it."}, {"start": 475.911, "end": 477.911, "text": "For me, it's life and death."}, {"start": 477.911, "end": 478.911, "text": "And I win."}, {"start": 478.911, "end": 480.911, "text": "That's where you have to go."}, {"start": 480.911, "end": 482.911, "text": "No more thought, no more feeling."}, {"start": 482.911, "end": 484.911, "text": "Kill or be killed."}, {"start": 484.911, "end": 486.911, "text": "Kill or be killed, little man."}, {"start": 486.911, "end": 487.911, "text": "Get back to winning this game, Anna,"}, {"start": 487.911, "end": 488.911, "text": "before you've got to be too cool."}, {"start": 488.911, "end": 490.911, "text": "Start backing like you're not ashamed right now."}, {"start": 490.911, "end": 492.911, "text": "Follow that shame to the fear."}, {"start": 492.911, "end": 494.911, "text": "Follow that fear to the rage."}, {"start": 494.911, "end": 496.911, "text": "Put that rage."}, {"start": 496.911, "end": 499.911, "text": "Up your ass, Turkey."}, {"start": 499.911, "end": 501.911, "text": "There's only two ways off this table."}, {"start": 501.911, "end": 502.911, "text": "Kill or be killed."}, {"start": 502.911, "end": 503.911, "text": "Say it."}, {"start": 503.911, "end": 504.911, "text": "Kill or be killed."}, {"start": 504.911, "end": 505.911, "text": "I said say it, bumble."}, {"start": 505.911, "end": 506.911, "text": "Kill or be killed."}, {"start": 506.911, "end": 507.911, "text": "Kill!"}, {"start": 507.911, "end": 508.911, "text": "Kill!"}, {"start": 513.9110000000001, "end": 515.9110000000001, "text": "You called me Turkey."}, {"start": 515.9110000000001, "end": 517.9110000000001, "text": "I love it."}, {"start": 522.512, "end": 524.512, "text": "Sorry we couldn't get a car over here until now."}, {"start": 524.512, "end": 526.512, "text": "Our captain was killed on duty last night."}, {"start": 526.512, "end": 528.512, "text": "My God, I'm so sorry."}, {"start": 528.512, "end": 529.512, "text": "Yeah, good man."}, {"start": 529.512, "end": 532.512, "text": "Leaves behind two kids and a pregnant wife."}, {"start": 532.512, "end": 534.512, "text": "So you're missing a Batman DVD?"}, {"start": 534.512, "end": 536.512, "text": "My Dark Knight extended extended cut?"}, {"start": 536.512, "end": 537.512, "text": "It wasn't insured."}, {"start": 537.512, "end": 539.512, "text": "Well, there's no sign of forced entry in your door or windows."}, {"start": 539.512, "end": 541.512, "text": "You're sure it wasn't just misplaced?"}, {"start": 541.512, "end": 542.512, "text": "Someone definitely broke in."}, {"start": 542.512, "end": 544.512, "text": "Some of my jewelry's missing."}, {"start": 544.512, "end": 545.512, "text": "You sure about that, Annie?"}, {"start": 545.512, "end": 546.512, "text": "Uh-huh."}, {"start": 546.512, "end": 547.512, "text": "My necklace."}, {"start": 547.512, "end": 548.512, "text": "It was gold."}, {"start": 548.512, "end": 549.512, "text": "White gold."}, {"start": 549.512, "end": 550.512, "text": "With emeralds."}, {"start": 550.512, "end": 551.512, "text": "And my name engraved."}, {"start": 551.512, "end": 553.512, "text": "In Hebrew, it was a bat mitzvah gift from my nana."}, {"start": 553.512, "end": 554.512, "text": "She was a rock cat."}, {"start": 554.512, "end": 555.512, "text": "She married a count."}, {"start": 555.512, "end": 556.512, "text": "He was blind."}, {"start": 556.512, "end": 558.512, "text": "He loved her for her mind."}, {"start": 558.512, "end": 559.512, "text": "That's good color for the report,"}, {"start": 559.512, "end": 560.512, "text": "but I gotta be honest."}, {"start": 560.512, "end": 563.512, "text": "Small stuff like this almost never turns up."}, {"start": 563.512, "end": 564.512, "text": "Oh, no, Abed!"}, {"start": 564.512, "end": 565.512, "text": "We'll be in touch."}, {"start": 565.512, "end": 567.512, "text": "Say, you look familiar."}, {"start": 567.512, "end": 569.512, "text": "Did I ever pretend to shoot a guy in front of you"}, {"start": 569.512, "end": 571.512, "text": "to teach you about gun safety?"}, {"start": 574.1649999999998, "end": 576.1649999999998, "text": "I'm really good at faces."}, {"start": 576.1649999999998, "end": 578.1649999999998, "text": "Well, I guess the only upside to this is"}, {"start": 578.1649999999998, "end": 580.1649999999998, "text": "it's brought us closer together as roommates."}, {"start": 580.1649999999998, "end": 582.1649999999998, "text": "Something doesn't add up."}, {"start": 582.1649999999998, "end": 584.1649999999998, "text": "If there was no forced entry, it had to be an inside job."}, {"start": 584.1649999999998, "end": 585.1649999999998, "text": "We don't know that."}, {"start": 585.1649999999998, "end": 587.1649999999998, "text": "And instead of taking cash, pharmaceuticals, laptops,"}, {"start": 587.1649999999998, "end": 588.1649999999998, "text": "they'd take what?"}, {"start": 588.1649999999998, "end": 589.1649999999998, "text": "My Batman DVD."}, {"start": 589.1649999999998, "end": 592.1649999999998, "text": "And one piece of oddly ornate Hebrew-themed jewelry?"}, {"start": 592.1649999999998, "end": 593.1649999999998, "text": "Nana gave it."}, {"start": 593.1649999999998, "end": 595.1649999999998, "text": "It's smoke, it's a ruse, a lie."}, {"start": 595.1649999999998, "end": 598.1649999999998, "text": "I think I know what happened here."}, {"start": 598.1649999999998, "end": 599.1649999999998, "text": "Abed."}, {"start": 599.1649999999998, "end": 601.1649999999998, "text": "The landlord did it."}, {"start": 601.1649999999998, "end": 602.1649999999998, "text": "It all makes sense."}, {"start": 602.1649999999998, "end": 604.1649999999998, "text": "Rick has keys to every apartment, means."}, {"start": 604.1649999999998, "end": 606.1649999999998, "text": "He knows when we're coming and going, opportunity."}, {"start": 606.1649999999998, "end": 610.1649999999998, "text": "And he was dressed as the Joker for Halloween, motive."}, {"start": 610.1649999999998, "end": 611.1649999999998, "text": "Hmm."}, {"start": 611.1649999999998, "end": 612.1649999999998, "text": "Something's gotta be done."}, {"start": 612.1649999999998, "end": 615.1649999999998, "text": "Oh, let's not leak the thing-doing."}, {"start": 615.1649999999998, "end": 616.1649999999998, "text": "Right, Annie?"}, {"start": 616.1649999999998, "end": 621.1649999999998, "text": "[siren]"}, {"start": 621.1649999999998, "end": 622.1649999999998, "text": "Double strike."}, {"start": 622.1649999999998, "end": 623.1649999999998, "text": "Got it."}, {"start": 623.1649999999998, "end": 624.1649999999998, "text": "Back blast."}, {"start": 624.1649999999998, "end": 625.1649999999998, "text": "Boom."}, {"start": 625.1649999999998, "end": 627.1649999999998, "text": "Viper shots."}, {"start": 627.1649999999998, "end": 629.1649999999998, "text": "Damn it."}, {"start": 629.1649999999998, "end": 630.1649999999998, "text": "Oh, look."}, {"start": 630.1649999999998, "end": 631.1649999999998, "text": "How cute."}, {"start": 631.1649999999998, "end": 632.1649999999998, "text": "You do like foosball."}, {"start": 632.1649999999998, "end": 634.1649999999998, "text": "You just have to practice with your mama."}, {"start": 634.1649999999998, "end": 636.1649999999998, "text": "What are you guys doing here on a Saturday night?"}, {"start": 636.1649999999998, "end": 639.1649999999998, "text": "Shouldn't you be making weird art movies or well-engineered cars?"}, {"start": 639.1649999999998, "end": 640.1649999999998, "text": "You takes it, Vic."}, {"start": 640.1649999999998, "end": 640.908, "text": "We came to play."}, {"start": 640.908, "end": 642.0803636363637, "text": "- Get away from our table."}, {"start": 642.0803636363637, "end": 643.388, "text": "- We're using a Strudelbrane."}, {"start": 643.388, "end": 643.8794285714285, "text": "- Nice."}, {"start": 643.8794285714285, "end": 645.2835102040816, "text": "Then play us for it."}, {"start": 645.2835102040816, "end": 645.7749387755101, "text": "- Fine."}, {"start": 645.7749387755101, "end": 646.828, "text": "Monday morning."}, {"start": 646.828, "end": 648.329052631579, "text": "Only let's make it interesting."}, {"start": 648.329052631579, "end": 650.508, "text": "The losers never get to use this table again."}, {"start": 650.508, "end": 655.308, "text": "Oh, you are so on that things have now become very much like Donkey Kong."}, {"start": 655.308, "end": 657.068, "text": "We're gonna kick Dust Butt."}, {"start": 657.068, "end": 657.3922105263158, "text": "- Nice."}, {"start": 657.3922105263158, "end": 657.948, "text": "- Thank you."}, {"start": 657.948, "end": 659.7230943396227, "text": "Enough Teutonic Punnery."}, {"start": 659.7230943396227, "end": 661.868, "text": "Monday morning, you get this."}, {"start": 666.1080000000001, "end": 668.988, "text": "Were you guys walking around with a soccer ball just so you could do that?"}, {"start": 671.308, "end": 672.588, "text": "They left the ball on everything."}, {"start": 673.548, "end": 676.668, "text": "I think they were literally walking around with it like a prop to use."}, {"start": 677.388, "end": 678.5516363636364, "text": "It's like a $25 bit."}, {"start": 678.5516363636364, "end": 679.948, "text": "It's not even that good."}, {"start": 682.508, "end": 683.788, "text": "You have got to come clean, okay?"}, {"start": 683.788, "end": 685.788, "text": "I don't know what he's doing in there, but it feels dramatic."}, {"start": 685.788, "end": 688.028, "text": "I'm sure he's already moved on to some other obsession."}, {"start": 690.668, "end": 691.7756923076923, "text": "Oh, look."}, {"start": 691.7756923076923, "end": 692.268, "text": "Fun."}, {"start": 692.268, "end": 693.6013333333334, "text": "The police are powerless."}, {"start": 693.6013333333334, "end": 695.628, "text": "I must take justice into my own hands."}, {"start": 696.268, "end": 698.348, "text": "Men like Rick operate above the law."}, {"start": 699.148, "end": 702.7374339622642, "text": "But there's something else above the law."}, {"start": 702.7374339622642, "end": 703.1751698113208, "text": "Bets."}, {"start": 703.1751698113208, "end": 703.788, "text": "And me."}, {"start": 705.708, "end": 707.948, "text": "Oven, don't do anything drastic."}, {"start": 707.948, "end": 710.348, "text": "Yeah, maybe we should all just take a step back and-"}, {"start": 710.348, "end": 713.308, "text": "Oh, is that the grappling hook I got you for Christmas?"}, {"start": 713.308, "end": 714.4319024390244, "text": "The night beckons."}, {"start": 714.4319024390244, "end": 718.428, "text": "It's black fingers, curl and uncurl, going like, hey, come here."}, {"start": 720.428, "end": 720.908, "text": "Oven!"}, {"start": 720.908, "end": 721.964, "text": "Wait, wait."}, {"start": 721.964, "end": 722.828, "text": "I did it."}, {"start": 722.828, "end": 726.1080000000001, "text": "I stepped on your DVD and it broke and I staged a break-in to cover it up."}, {"start": 727.548, "end": 730.668, "text": "If that were true, you would have come forward a long time ago."}, {"start": 731.708, "end": 735.2280000000001, "text": "You're lying to keep me out of danger, but there can be no peace"}, {"start": 735.2280000000001, "end": 737.868, "text": "while crime spits and dances on the grief of justice"}, {"start": 737.868, "end": 740.188, "text": "to the hotbeats and infectious rhythms of all that is wrong."}, {"start": 746.588, "end": 747.388, "text": "Here's your foot."}, {"start": 748.988, "end": 749.388, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 754.908, "end": 756.668, "text": "Troy, what are we gonna do?"}, {"start": 756.668, "end": 758.1080000000001, "text": "Now you're open to input!"}, {"start": 758.1080000000001, "end": 758.908, "text": "I'm following him."}, {"start": 759.708, "end": 762.428, "text": "You moving in here was supposed to tone us down."}, {"start": 764.588, "end": 766.8411764705883, "text": "So Shirley, tell me, how does someone with"}, {"start": 766.8411764705883, "end": 769.148, "text": "your talent for foosball ever stop playing?"}, {"start": 769.148, "end": 770.588, "text": "Oh, I don't want to talk about that."}, {"start": 770.588, "end": 771.38, "text": "Oh, come on."}, {"start": 771.38, "end": 773.2280000000001, "text": "We're like best friends now."}, {"start": 773.2280000000001, "end": 774.58, "text": "Don't back away from this."}, {"start": 774.58, "end": 775.308, "text": "Open up to me."}, {"start": 776.428, "end": 779.548, "text": "Okay, well, when I was a kid, I had anger, Jeff."}, {"start": 780.508, "end": 783.388, "text": "Real bad anger and foosball was a release."}, {"start": 784.268, "end": 786.372888888889, "text": "Well, I didn't just beat people."}, {"start": 786.372888888889, "end": 787.2280000000001, "text": "I broke them."}, {"start": 788.188, "end": 790.988, "text": "One time I was running this table over at this YMCA across town,"}, {"start": 790.988, "end": 793.788, "text": "and I was really giving it to this kid, this skinny little white boy."}, {"start": 793.788, "end": 794.668, "text": "No peace."}, {"start": 794.668, "end": 796.108, "text": "And they started crying."}, {"start": 796.108, "end": 798.028, "text": "They always started crying."}, {"start": 798.028, "end": 800.748, "text": "Something about this boy made me want to take it all the way."}, {"start": 800.748, "end": 805.2280000000001, "text": "I started jabbing him with the rods until the boy peed himself."}, {"start": 805.868, "end": 806.845142857143, "text": "Everybody laughed."}, {"start": 806.845142857143, "end": 807.388, "text": "I laughed."}, {"start": 807.388, "end": 810.748, "text": "But after that, the game lost its flavor."}, {"start": 811.628, "end": 813.2374117647059, "text": "Once you make a boy pee his pants, you"}, {"start": 813.2374117647059, "end": 815.2280000000001, "text": "start thinking about where your life is headed."}, {"start": 815.2280000000001, "end": 816.028, "text": "Jeff, what's wrong?"}, {"start": 821.8100000000001, "end": 824.9300000000001, "text": "I gotta tell you, your ass is mine."}, {"start": 824.9300000000001, "end": 826.21, "text": "You're such a punk."}, {"start": 826.21, "end": 827.8100000000001, "text": "You like being beat by a girl?"}, {"start": 828.69, "end": 829.1700000000001, "text": "Yes!"}, {"start": 830.85, "end": 832.3700000000001, "text": "What are you crying for?"}, {"start": 832.3700000000001, "end": 834.2900000000001, "text": "Your mama cannot help you."}, {"start": 834.2900000000001, "end": 836.0500000000001, "text": "Can I know your daddy ain't around?"}, {"start": 836.0500000000001, "end": 837.4100000000001, "text": "Are you gonna play like a bitch?"}, {"start": 845.09, "end": 847.09, "text": "Oh my goodness gracious."}, {"start": 847.09, "end": 848.61, "text": "Is that what I think?"}, {"start": 848.61, "end": 851.09, "text": "I just beat this kid all the way to Tinkle Town."}, {"start": 862.1300000000001, "end": 863.6500000000001, "text": "You were Big Cheddar?"}, {"start": 863.6500000000001, "end": 864.21, "text": "Who told you?"}, {"start": 866.0500000000001, "end": 866.9300000000001, "text": "Oh dear lord."}, {"start": 869.33, "end": 870.5300000000001, "text": "Your Tinkle Town?"}, {"start": 870.5300000000001, "end": 871.4100000000001, "text": "Don't tell me that."}, {"start": 873.01, "end": 875.57, "text": "Oh, your fake sweetness in religion."}, {"start": 875.57, "end": 878.2900000000001, "text": "It's just a veil covering a horrible monster."}, {"start": 881.57, "end": 883.49, "text": "And I had a lot of men do that tape."}, {"start": 889.49, "end": 892.2030434782608, "text": "Sir Ziggy says there's an 80% chance you"}, {"start": 892.2030434782608, "end": 895.73, "text": "can't leave Woodstock until your bone needs hippies."}, {"start": 895.73, "end": 896.2900000000001, "text": "Oh boy."}, {"start": 903.01, "end": 909.8237931034483, "text": "You know what"}, {"start": 909.8237931034483, "end": 912.9686206896553, "text": "I came"}, {"start": 912.9686206896553, "end": 918.21, "text": "for, scum?"}, {"start": 918.21, "end": 918.9300000000001, "text": "Where is it?"}, {"start": 918.9300000000001, "end": 919.6500000000001, "text": "In the closet."}, {"start": 920.2900000000001, "end": 921.25, "text": "In the closet, man."}, {"start": 921.25, "end": 923.01, "text": "Obed, stop it!"}, {"start": 923.01, "end": 924.1300000000001, "text": "I mean, stop it."}, {"start": 924.1300000000001, "end": 924.9300000000001, "text": "They're in the closet."}, {"start": 925.49, "end": 926.45, "text": "I know I get caught."}, {"start": 926.45, "end": 928.53, "text": "Just don't hurt me, Batman."}, {"start": 929.09, "end": 929.6500000000001, "text": "Closet."}, {"start": 933.25, "end": 933.75, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 935.25, "end": 936.1300000000001, "text": "Women's shoes?"}, {"start": 937.01, "end": 938.0500000000001, "text": "Rick doesn't have a wife."}, {"start": 939.25, "end": 940.53, "text": "All women's feet."}, {"start": 941.09, "end": 943.73, "text": "Wait, my summertime ballet flats."}, {"start": 943.73, "end": 945.01, "text": "I thought I lost these in the move."}, {"start": 945.01, "end": 945.8100000000001, "text": "Is it there?"}, {"start": 945.8100000000001, "end": 947.25, "text": "Does he have the DVD?"}, {"start": 947.25, "end": 948.0500000000001, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 948.0500000000001, "end": 948.69, "text": "The DVD."}, {"start": 950.2900000000001, "end": 953.4100000000001, "text": "He has it all right and it looks like he broke it."}, {"start": 956.5049999999999, "end": 957.4649999999999, "text": "Who are you?"}, {"start": 963.845, "end": 966.645, "text": "If you had something to say, why not put it in the text message?"}, {"start": 967.285, "end": 968.565, "text": "I wasn't sure what to say."}, {"start": 969.125, "end": 971.845, "text": "Do you understand what you did to me?"}, {"start": 972.405, "end": 973.2049999999999, "text": "Big cheddar."}, {"start": 973.2049999999999, "end": 974.325, "text": "Please don't call me that."}, {"start": 974.325, "end": 974.8050000000001, "text": "Why not?"}, {"start": 975.365, "end": 976.085, "text": "It's what you are."}, {"start": 976.645, "end": 978.565, "text": "A mean, nasty bully."}, {"start": 978.565, "end": 980.4849999999999, "text": "I was 12 years old."}, {"start": 980.4849999999999, "end": 981.285, "text": "I peed."}, {"start": 981.925, "end": 983.605, "text": "I had to change schools."}, {"start": 983.605, "end": 985.125, "text": "I changed everything."}, {"start": 985.125, "end": 988.7249999999999, "text": "My clothes, my hair, my personality because of you."}, {"start": 989.365, "end": 990.245, "text": "What a waste."}, {"start": 991.125, "end": 994.565, "text": "I wish I could take a picture of you right now and send it to my 10-year-old self."}, {"start": 994.565, "end": 995.765, "text": "Watch it, Winger."}, {"start": 995.765, "end": 997.925, "text": "You don't have a trademark on self-pity."}, {"start": 997.925, "end": 999.525, "text": "I will defend myself."}, {"start": 999.525, "end": 999.925, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 1000.4849999999999, "end": 1001.365, "text": "Bring the cheddar."}, {"start": 1002.005, "end": 1003.2049999999999, "text": "Big cheddar."}, {"start": 1003.2049999999999, "end": 1006.245, "text": "I'm going to put you on the express train back to tanko town."}, {"start": 1027.925, "end": 1054.805, "text": "[SCREAMING]"}, {"start": 1054.805, "end": 1056.325, "text": "You get it."}, {"start": 1056.325, "end": 1057.205, "text": "No, you get it."}, {"start": 1057.205, "end": 1058.565, "text": "You're the one that needs the advantage."}, {"start": 1059.205, "end": 1059.605, "text": "Wrong!"}, {"start": 1060.165, "end": 1061.125, "text": "Wrong!"}, {"start": 1061.125, "end": 1063.605, "text": "Every game I ever won, I won fairly."}, {"start": 1063.605, "end": 1065.845, "text": "Boostball was how I measured my value as a man."}, {"start": 1065.845, "end": 1066.965, "text": "You took that away."}, {"start": 1066.965, "end": 1068.245, "text": "Why do you think I had to?"}, {"start": 1068.245, "end": 1070.885, "text": "You tried sprouting three feet just when boys were about to look at you."}, {"start": 1070.885, "end": 1072.645, "text": "Everyone stopped liking me."}, {"start": 1072.645, "end": 1074.005, "text": "This game is all I had."}, {"start": 1074.005, "end": 1075.125, "text": "It's all I had."}, {"start": 1075.125, "end": 1076.245, "text": "Well, that's stupid."}, {"start": 1076.245, "end": 1077.7649999999999, "text": "You're a perfectly fine person."}, {"start": 1079.2849999999999, "end": 1079.925, "text": "So are you."}, {"start": 1081.605, "end": 1082.165, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 1083.7649999999999, "end": 1084.405, "text": "You're welcome."}, {"start": 1085.2849999999999, "end": 1086.405, "text": "I'm sorry, Jeff."}, {"start": 1090.216, "end": 1091.9759999999999, "text": "You don't have anything to be sorry for, surely."}, {"start": 1096.608, "end": 1100.208, "text": "So Rick has agreed to stay out of your apartment as long as you stay out of his."}, {"start": 1100.208, "end": 1102.048, "text": "And I'm getting tired of saying this to people."}, {"start": 1102.048, "end": 1104.9279999999999, "text": "But these things wouldn't happen if you'd invest in a simple shoe safe."}, {"start": 1105.568, "end": 1106.368, "text": "That's it?"}, {"start": 1106.368, "end": 1111.568, "text": "Now we just live upstairs from this guy that's really into footwear?"}, {"start": 1111.568, "end": 1112.608, "text": "Sweetie, you're a renter."}, {"start": 1113.1680000000001, "end": 1114.608, "text": "Look forward to owning a house."}, {"start": 1114.608, "end": 1116.048, "text": "Be glad he's not into heads."}, {"start": 1116.048, "end": 1117.408, "text": "Thanks for your help, officer."}, {"start": 1117.408, "end": 1120.1280000000002, "text": "And if you should ever need me, I usually get out of school around four."}, {"start": 1121.6480000000001, "end": 1123.728, "text": "This guy sleeps outside your room, though, and that's okay?"}, {"start": 1125.728, "end": 1127.088, "text": "There's one thing I don't understand."}, {"start": 1128.528, "end": 1130.768, "text": "Why would Rick deny taking my DVD?"}, {"start": 1130.768, "end": 1131.808, "text": "And why break it?"}, {"start": 1131.808, "end": 1134.849081081081, "text": "Oh, maybe he stepped on it by"}, {"start": 1134.849081081081, "end": 1139.568, "text": "accident and felt really, really, really bad."}, {"start": 1139.568, "end": 1140.848, "text": "Oh, the more reason to confess."}, {"start": 1140.848, "end": 1142.448, "text": "Well, not everybody's perfect, Abed."}, {"start": 1142.448, "end": 1143.248, "text": "Batman."}, {"start": 1143.248, "end": 1144.288, "text": "And I am."}, {"start": 1144.288, "end": 1149.888, "text": "Well, Batman, on behalf of all of us that aren't perfect, can I just say,"}, {"start": 1150.528, "end": 1151.888, "text": "I'm sorry I broke your DVD."}, {"start": 1152.9279999999999, "end": 1153.888, "text": "Apology accepted."}, {"start": 1154.688, "end": 1155.888, "text": "But I wouldn't mention it to Abed."}, {"start": 1155.888, "end": 1156.9279999999999, "text": "That guy's pretty ruthless."}, {"start": 1157.568, "end": 1158.608, "text": "And that's coming from Batman."}, {"start": 1165.888, "end": 1166.768, "text": "Hey, guys."}, {"start": 1166.768, "end": 1168.848, "text": "Abed, where have you been?"}, {"start": 1168.848, "end": 1170.208, "text": "Troy, really?"}, {"start": 1170.208, "end": 1170.768, "text": "Let's go."}, {"start": 1170.768, "end": 1173.248, "text": "Oh, black in the house."}, {"start": 1174.048, "end": 1175.248, "text": "My head is crimping."}, {"start": 1175.248, "end": 1175.9679999999998, "text": "It's fine."}, {"start": 1177.328, "end": 1179.5573333333332, "text": "Oh, he Freuden Katzen."}, {"start": 1179.5573333333332, "end": 1181.888, "text": "Ready for your spunken?"}, {"start": 1183.488, "end": 1184.768, "text": "Just like we practiced?"}, {"start": 1184.768, "end": 1185.488, "text": "Shut him down."}, {"start": 1188.208, "end": 1193.248, "text": "Let's dance, Dauphin Bowie."}, {"start": 1206.1280000000002, "end": 1207.568, "text": "It's a ball, Carl!"}, {"start": 1207.568, "end": 1209.328, "text": "Frank, stop getting at me!"}, {"start": 1209.328, "end": 1210.9279999999999, "text": "It's such a fine move."}, {"start": 1210.9279999999999, "end": 1211.408, "text": "It's just a word."}, {"start": 1211.408, "end": 1212.6080000000002, "text": "Aren't you guys playing foosball?"}, {"start": 1212.6080000000002, "end": 1214.288, "text": "We've played them out for one lifetime."}, {"start": 1214.288, "end": 1215.488, "text": "We're gonna go see a movie."}, {"start": 1221.248, "end": 1222.6080000000002, "text": "Since when are those two so close?"}, {"start": 1233.248, "end": 1237.728, "text": "Well, this is November 29th, and I'm Leonard."}, {"start": 1238.288, "end": 1243.408, "text": "And today, I'm reviewing Eugenio's Four Cheese Frozen Pizza."}, {"start": 1243.408, "end": 1245.1680000000001, "text": "That's $5.99 at Kroger's."}, {"start": 1246.048, "end": 1248.768, "text": "I've tried it before, and we'll see."}, {"start": 1256.8719999999998, "end": 1257.5119999999997, "text": "Cheese is good."}, {"start": 1259.9119999999998, "end": 1261.1119999999999, "text": "The part is good, too."}, {"start": 1262.1519999999998, "end": 1263.272, "text": "It's definitely a bye."}, {"start": 1264.792, "end": 1267.6719999999998, "text": "Eugenio's Four Cheese Frozen Pizza."}, {"start": 1267.6719999999998, "end": 1268.1519999999998, "text": "A bye."}, {"start": 1270.5519999999997, "end": 1271.4319999999998, "text": "See you next time."}]}